  {
   "id": "aerial-knight-s-never-yield-138206@major-2022-01-28",
   "gameId": "aerial-knight-s-never-yield-138206",
   "displayName": "\"Da Update\" adds new content and improvements to Never Yield in February!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-01-28T14:53:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey hey friends,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "it's Neil aka Aerial_Knight! I have been very quiet for some time, but that had its reasons. I was busy working on Never Yield to optimize my game even more to bring you the ULTIMATE Aerial_Knight's Never Yield experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's why I'm really happy to announce \"Da Update\" to you! As the name implies, I will release a major update for Never Yield, which will add a massive load of new stuff and improvements:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Bonus Levels",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Music",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Endless Mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Leaderboards",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "UI Overhall",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Graphical Updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Achievements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Level & Story Updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The release is planed for February - so you don't have to wait much longer for the update. So grab your running shoes and get ready!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Oh, and the update will be released completely free of charge, of course! 👍🏿",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Till then and take care everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Neil 'Aerial_Knight' Jones",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
